== CANON-13 Q1 (range-types): a value computed in a Range that falls outside
== it, stored into it, stops the program with "value out of range" (kind 11).
Type
    TMonth Range 1..12

Main :
    M TMonth := 12
    PutLn(M)
    M := M + 1
    PutLn(M)
;
